CHAPTER.VERS:
And you

          {+}
         know that he was manifested to take away sins; and in him is no sin.

[My] little children, let no man lead you

          {+}
         astray: he who does righteousness is righteous, even as he is righteous:

For this is the message which you

          {+}
         heard from the beginning, that we should love one another:

And don't marvel, brothers, if the world hates you

          {+}
        .

Whoever hates his brother is a murderer: and you

          {+}
         know that any murderer does not have eternal life staying in him.
